    "text": "CONCLUDED\n1 day ago\nAn Apple bull says the WWDC event 'did not disappoint'\nStock action notwithstanding, Wedbush analyst Daniel Ives wrote that Apple's keynote \"did not disappoint\" as the company \"finally unveiled an AI strategy that will unleash the true monetization opportunity for AI.\"\nHe thinks AI services and the associated monetization opportunity could add $75 to $100 to Apple's stock price.\n\"Now the AI foundation is unveiled for Apple as we foresee a new and imagined hardware/iPhone lineup over the next few years to follow,\" Ives added.",
    "text_blocks": [
      "CONCLUDED",
      "1 day ago",
      "An Apple bull says the WWDC event 'did not disappoint'",
      "Stock action notwithstanding, Wedbush analyst Daniel Ives wrote that Apple's keynote \"did not disappoint\" as the company \"finally unveiled an AI strategy that will unleash the true monetization opportunity for AI.\"",
      "He thinks AI services and the associated monetization opportunity could add $75 to $100 to Apple's stock price.",
      "\"Now the AI foundation is unveiled for Apple as we foresee a new and imagined hardware/iPhone lineup over the next few years to follow,\" Ives added."
